WEBVTT

00:18:57.971 --> 00:19:00.283
to some of your political thinking.

00:19:00.307 --> 00:19:04.493
Make that case, that the neighborhood
is the unit of change.

00:19:04.517 --> 00:19:05.766
That, at one level,

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:09.259
fundamentally contradicts
the anchoring idea of neoliberalism,

00:19:09.283 --> 00:19:11.466
which is that it's about the individual,

00:19:11.490 --> 00:19:16.566
that you build a society based on
life, liberty, the pursuit of happiness.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:20.913
That is really a statement, or it seems
to be a statement about individuals,

00:19:20.937 --> 00:19:23.387
and you give people
as much freedom as they can,

00:19:23.411 --> 00:19:25.488
so long as they don't bump into others --

00:19:25.512 --> 00:19:27.423
that is how we should think about life.

00:19:27.447 --> 00:19:31.706
And to say, no, we've got
something wrong here,